                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Our goal is to make English grammar spatial and memorable. Abstract rules — conditionals, the passive, phrasal verbs — become rooms you can enter, look around, and move through at your own pace.",
